Package: typesafer
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the 'TypeSafe' AI API
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-25
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Fernando",
           family = "Reis",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fernando@lopesreis.eu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-8479-4412"))
Description: An R interface to the 'TypeSafe' AI API <https://docs.typesafe.ai/>
    for model discovery and evaluation of named Noul, Choice and Score questions
    against supplied content. The client is designed to preserve the API request and response
    structures, including probabilities, confidence values and token usage.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/reisfe/typesafer, https://docs.typesafe.ai/
